# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's M1 package (matmul grids for the 13x10 compute grid; docs/tp4-fusion-m1.md): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the fusion integration branch (with fusion-wp/M1.json placed by make_fusion_profiles.py --write and fusion-wp/M1-tp-addresses.patch applied) and
# push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its
# author. M1/ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag the pack's B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# M1L1 (TIMED, M1): the LEVER (B1) of the decode ABAB at eight live: c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-grid13. concurrent8_steady, every boot a fresh reset, NO audit (the audits add work), C2_TELEMETRY=1 (the sidecar reads the ARC table once a second; it is on both arms).
# The LEVER arm adds only QWEN_FAST_GRID13=1 to the combined fusion arm.
# READ: c2_smoke_check clean (a lever arm also has its engaged lines and no fell-back line), no stall; then PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians: python3 scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py pair <control
# container log> <lever container log> --window steady --a-smoke <control smoke log> --b-smoke <lever smoke log> for (M1C1, M1L1) and (M1C2, M1L2), and its floor subcommand over the two control logs; the texts equal
# (text_mismatches empty) and the accepted prefixes equal. ESTIMATE to beat (not a measurement): the verify block's two output-projection sets (64 calls a pass) from 28 us to about 26 us is -0.13 ms a pass
# and the fused commit's feature projection (+32 us each on 13x10) -0.25 ms a round: together under 0.6 ms of a ~125 ms round, which is inside the control-to-control floor; this ABAB is the proof of NO LOSS and
# of the partition-sweep names to try next (QWEN_FAST_GRID13_CFG=out=4, out=2, gdn_in=2, attn_in=2), not a source of gain. Duration (estimate): 35 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-all-grid13
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady
C2_TELEMETRY=1
